                "location": {
                  "line": 11,
                  "heading": "Overview"
                },
                "text": "The Aventro Prime is an advanced sedan that blends style, comfort, and technology for the discerning modern driver. Designed for those who seek luxury and performance, the Prime boasts a sleek aerodynamic profile, a spacious interior, and state-of-the-art features across its variants. The Prime is available in four efficient powertrains: Petrol, Diesel, Electric, and Hybrid."
              }
